id: combat-observation
name: Combat Observation
talentCategory: racial
race: shinjin
prerequisites: Shinjin
description: >
  By carefully studying your opponents, you are able to accurately predict how they will fight, and adjust your own tactics accordingly.
text: >
  Combat Observation: By carefully studying your opponents, you are able to accurately predict how they will fight, and adjust your own tactics accordingly.
  –Prerequisites: Shinjin
  (1)-[Triggered]: If you are targeted by an Attacking Maneuver, you may spend a Counter Action to increase your Defense Value and Soak Value by 1(T) for the duration of that Attacking Maneuver.
  (2)-[Triggered]: When making an Attacking Maneuver, you may spend a Counter Action to increase your Strike and Wound Rolls by 1(T) for the duration of that Attacking Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1) Targeted: a button on the attack's card till it is settled - a Counter Action, Defense Value and Soak Value 1(T) for it, once
# an attack (chat.mjs observationButtons).
allow observation.defend;
# (2) Your attack: a button on its card till its Strike is rolled - a Counter Action, Strike and Wound 1(T) for it, once an attack.
allow observation.attack;
